      "content": "The ZeroSettle IAP API powers the iOS, Android, and Flutter SDKs. It enables product catalog fetching, web checkout, entitlement management, subscription lifecycle operations, and StoreKit transaction syncing. All endpoints are authenticated via the `X-ZeroSettle-Key` header.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: ZeroSettle Support\n Email: support@zerosettle.io",
